%    (C) 2004 Per-Olof Persson. 
%    See COPYRIGHT.TXT for details.
%
%  Reference:
%
%    Per-Olof Persson and Gilbert Strang,
%    A Simple Mesh Generator in MATLAB,
%    SIAM Review,
%    Volume 46, Number 2, June 2004, pages 329-345.
